7	/**
8	 * Flags an owner whose city is approaching its capacity limit: sets
9	 * {@link Owner#getCapacityWarning() capacityWarning} true when the city already holds between
10	 * {@value #WARNING_THRESHOLD} and {@link RequireCityCapacity#CAPACITY} (exclusive) owners,
11	 * otherwise false. Runs after {@link RequireCityCapacity} has admitted the request, so the
12	 * count is always below the hard limit.
